-- title:
--   LIDT definitions: LDT / Pasting / Bernoulli / FromHToG / AdjacentStages / Chain / HalfSandwich
-- statement:
--   This bundle defines the second and third scalar stages in the from-$H$-to-$G$ telescope. Each stage is an averaged expectation of completed-slice half-products, with the successive definitions exposing the two half-sandwich commutations used to move one factor through the chain.
--
--   Principal definitions:
--   - `fromHToGAdjacentStageM2`: The scalar obtained after the first half-sandwich move, with the exposed completed-slice factor placed on the right side of the remaining half-product.
--   - `fromHToGAdjacentStageM3`: The scalar obtained after the second half-sandwich move, with the adjoint half-product on the left and the moved factor in its final position before the remaining tensor action.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
